t_pty_test`, `fa_llm_mock_config_test`, plus the whole `builtin_tools_test` `shellTool` suite and `shell_jobs_test` in Core. Signature 1 looks like collateral damage from that harness-level breakage, not a live-leg settle flake in this file.\n\n---\n\n### Signature 2 — [run 37798533323](https://github.com/IstiN/flutter_agent_harness/actions/runs/37798533323) @ `d0c2224a` (2026-10-08T15:13:32Z): resumed-tail equality off-by-one\n\n**Throw site**: `expect(shared, liveTail, …)` — `test/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 313:9`:\n\n```text\nWhich: at location [0] is 'bash: echo pinned-render-1' instead of 'bash: sleep 2 && echo bg-pinned-render'\npackage:matcher                                          expect\ntest/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 313:9  main.<fn>\n```\n\nBoth windows are 9 rows. The resumed viewport rendered the same tail **without the final settled row** (`✓ done pty446  0s  – reply with the single word ok`) and with one extra older row (`bash: echo pinned-render-1`) at the head — the resume replay's tail render lagged one row short, so the sliding window aligned one row earlier:\n\n```text\nlive tail (expected)                resumed tail window (actual)\nbash: sleep 2 && echo bg-…          bash: echo pinned-render-1   ← one row older\ntask: PTY equivalence probe…        bash: sleep 2 && echo bg-…\n>_Fa done — the probes settled      task: PTY equivalence probe…\n│ ⚙ Background shell job …          >_Fa done — the probes settled\n… (rows 5–8 identical)              … (rows 4–8, shifted)\n✓ done pty446 0s  – reply …         (missing — tail ended one row short)\n```\n\nNo tool errors on either leg in this run — pure resume tail-render/settle timing (the final spinner-settle row absent from the resumed screen when the 700 ms settle snapshot was taken).\n\n---\n\n### Fix targeting\n\n1. **Signature 1**: root-cause the `Cannot modify an unmodifiable list` uncaught exception in the bash tool implementation (it breaks many suites, not just this file). If it recurs in isolation afterwards, revisit the 30 s banner wait.\n2. **Signature 2**: the resume render must paint the final settled status row (`✓ done …`) before the tail comparison snapshot — or the comparison must wait on that spinner-settle row explicitly instead of a fixed 700 ms settle.\n\n_Failure signatures extracted from the failed-job logs of both runs during the #1423 rework leg (ai-teammate)._"
}
"}

