  "body": "### Both proving-run failure signatures (from the #1423 review thread)\n\nThe two runs red-died at **two different assertion sites** inside `AC1: resume renders 1:1 with live (normalized diff empty)` — recording both here so the fix targets both flake modes. Per quarantine policy, un-quarantining (removing the entry from `scripts/test_quarantine.json` in PR #1423) requires the AC4 nightly repeat-run proof to show **both** paths green.\n\n---\n\n### Signature 1 — [run 37774628085](https://github.com/IstiN/flutter_agent_harness/actions/runs/37774628085) @ `77a4efc6` (2026-10-08T12:09:34Z): live-leg banner wait timed out\n\n**Throw site**: `await live.waitForText('Background shell job', timeout: 30s)` — `test/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 260:7` (via `test/integration/pty_harness.dart 127:3 pollUntil`):\n\n```text\n❌ test/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart: AC1: resume renders 1:1 with live (normalized diff empty) (failed)\nTimeoutException after 0:00:30.000: Timed out waiting for \"Background shell job\" in output.\ntest/integration/pty_harness.dart 127:3                  pollUntil\n===== asynchronous gap ===========================\ntest/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 260:7  main.<fn>\n```\n\nThe screen at timeout shows **both scripted `bash` calls had errored** — the background job never launched, so the `Background shell job` banner never painted:\n\n```text\n⟳ bash: echo pinned-render-1\n✘ bash: Tool error (bash): Cannot modify an unmodifiable list 0s\n⟳ bash: sleep 2 && echo bg-pinned-render\n✘ bash: Tool error (bash): Cannot modify an unmodifiable list 0s\n```\n\n**Context that points away from this test's own timing**: the same run had a run-wide outbreak of `Tool error (bash): Cannot modify an unmodifiable list` (\"an uncaught exception inside the harness tool implementation\") across **all shards** — `fa_cube_integration_test` (×7), `herdr_skill_test`, `composer_tui_grid_pty_test` (×6), `shell_job_running_count_pty_test`, `fa_llm_mock_config_test`, plus the whole `builtin_tools_test` `shellTool` suite and `shell_jobs_test` in Core. Signature 1 looks like collateral damage from that harness-level breakage, not a live-leg settle flake in this file.\n\n---\n\n### Signature 2 — [run 37798533323](https://github.com/IstiN/flutter_agent_harness/actions/runs/37798533323) @ `d0c2224a` (2026-10-08T15:13:32Z): resumed-tail equality off-by-one\n\n**Throw site**: `expect(shared, liveTail, …)` — `test/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 313:9`:\n\n```text\nWhich: at location [0] is 'bash: echo pinned-render-1' instead of 'bash: sleep 2 && echo bg-pinned-render'\npackage:matcher                                          expect\ntest/integration/pty_resume_equivalence_test.dart 313:9  main.<fn>\n```\n\nBoth windows are 9 rows. The resumed viewport rendered the same tail **without the final settled row** (`✓ done pty446  0s  – reply with the single word ok`) and with one extra older row (`bash: echo pinned-render-1`) at the head — the resume replay's tail render lagged one row short, so the sliding window aligned one row earlier:\n\n```text\nlive tail (expected)                resumed tail window (actual)\nbash: sleep 2 && echo bg-…          bash: echo pinned-render-1   ← one row older\ntask: PTY equivalence probe…        bash: sleep 2 && echo bg-…\n>_Fa done — the probes settled      task: PTY equivalence probe…\n│ ⚙ Background shell job …          >_Fa done — the probes settled\n… (rows 5–8 identical)              … (rows 4–8, shifted)\n✓ done pty446 0s  – reply …         (missing — tail ended one row short)\n```\n\nNo tool errors on either leg in this run — pure resume tail-render/settle timing (the final spinner-settle row absent from the resumed screen when the 700 ms settle snapshot was taken).\n\n---\n\n### Fix targeting\n\n1. **Signature 1**: root-cause the `Cannot modify an unmodifiable list` uncaught exception in the bash tool implementation (it breaks many suites, not just this file). If it recurs in isolation afterwards, revisit the 30 s banner wait.\n2. **Signature 2**: the resume render must paint the final settled status row (`✓ done …`) before the tail comparison snapshot — or the comparison must wait on that spinner-settle row explicitly instead of a fixed 700 ms settle.\n\n_Failure signatures extracted from the failed-job logs of both runs during the #1423 rework leg (ai-teammate)._"
